-        mediumTypeIStationaryKernel sigma T Q ∧
-      ‖typeIPowerReflectionIntegral sigma (-t + u)
-        ((Q : ℝ) / 2) (2 * M * Q)‖ ≤
-        mediumTypeIStationaryKernel sigma T Q := by
